NOTE: Lineage (two levels of derivation)

1. TypeScript → Rust port: crates.io `ag-psd` 0.1.0 (Vasyanator / Claude) is a
   Rust port derived from the ag-psd TypeScript library
   (https://github.com/Agamnentzar/ag-psd), licensed under the MIT License
   shown above. The original copyright (c) 2016 Agamnentzar is preserved.
   "Claude" above is an authorship credit, not a copyright holder.

2. Rust port → psdx: this crate (`psdx`) is a fork and continuation of that
   Rust 0.1.0 port (source taken from the crates.io tarball; the original
   GitHub repository is unavailable). It remains under the same MIT terms and
   retains the full copyright chain above. See README Credits.

3. JPEG thumbnail decode historically included a Rust port of jpeg-js
   (`src/jpeg.rs`, Copyright 2011 notmasteryet, Apache License 2.0; upstream
   `jpeg.ts` based on https://github.com/jpeg-js/jpeg-js). That decoder was
   unused in production (thumbnails use zune-jpeg / jpeg-encoder; Export As
   uses `image::codecs::jpeg`) and has been removed. This notice is retained
   for provenance.
